{"4405010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bloodshot Frontier", "steam_appid": 4405010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO NO MAN’S LAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodshot Frontier is a single-player round based experience, where you must shoot your way through endless waves of justice-hungry lawmen across the tightly designed, godforsaken sands of Jeremiah County.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE LAW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After recent funding from an ethically dubious oil baron, the law force of Jeremiah County stopped playing around. The longer you survive, the harder the law fights back, and the harder you will inevitably get dropped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FREE ROAM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your trigger finger gets tired, Free Roam mode provides an experience for those who wish to explore the blood ridden frontier, without the constant fear of being shot in the back of the head.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO NO MAN’S LAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodshot Frontier is a single-player round based experience, where you must shoot your way through endless waves of justice-hungry lawmen across the tightly designed, godforsaken sands of Jeremiah County.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE LAW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After recent funding from an ethically dubious oil baron, the law force of Jeremiah County stopped playing around. The longer you survive, the harder the law fights back, and the harder you will inevitably get dropped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FREE ROAM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your trigger finger gets tired, Free Roam mode provides an experience for those who wish to explore the blood ridden frontier, without the constant fear of being shot in the back of the head.</p>", "short_description